{"id":"4060a53d33b33591","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-lem-forgotten.md","title":"Forgotten Lemma","display":"lem-forgotten — Forgotten Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-forgotten","aliases":["58-lem-forgotten"],"display":"lem-forgotten — Forgotten Lemma","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-forgotten"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-forgotten</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-forgotten — Forgotten Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,f\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,f\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\">\\(B\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f``B\\coloneqq f[B]\">\\(f``B\\coloneqq f[B]\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function.md\">58-df-function.md</a> 的像。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}forgotten} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\forall f\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\left(|f``\\alpha|&lt;\\kappa\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}forgotten} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\forall f\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\left(|f``\\alpha|&lt;\\kappa\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Images of proper initial segments of an infinite initial ordinal have cardinality below that ordinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-funct